('NZ:chef','2026-08-11',null,31.00,64480,0,0,0,0,15,4,0,5,5,29,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ANZSCO 1.3 351311 Chef. Immigration NZ now recognises NOL chef subtypes for AEWV use, including 141113 Head Chef/Executive Chef, 351314 Chef de Partie, 351315 Sous Chef, 351311 Other Chef and 351313 Demi Chef de Partie.','shortage_note','Chef is not treated as a current Green List occupation; general hospitality recruitment pressure is not converted into shortage points.','visa_basis','Clear skilled occupation plus current NOL AEWV recognition for chef subtypes; ordinary work-visa credit 5/10, not Green List residence credit.','salary_method','Tahatū most-common range NZ$25–$37/hour; midpoint NZ$31/hour annualised at 2,080 hours to NZ$64,480; 4/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū lists experience and New Zealand Certificate in Cookery routes with training around 0–1 year; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory chef registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
('NZ:cook','2026-08-11',null,28.00,58240,0,0,0,0,15,2,0,5,5,27,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ANZSCO 1.3 351411 Cook.','shortage_note','Cook is not a current Green List occupation and no recurring occupation-specific shortage series is used.','visa_basis','Clear ANZSCO skilled occupation without targeted Green List residence treatment; 5/10.','salary_method','Tahatū most-common range NZ$24–$32/hour; midpoint NZ$28/hour annualised to NZ$58,240; 2/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū lists on-the-job and cookery training with training up to about three years; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory occupational registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
('NZ:hotel-manager','2026-08-11',null,38.70,80500,0,0,0,0,12,6,0,5,5,28,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ANZSCO 1.3 141311 Hotel or Motel Manager; Tahatū Accommodation Manager is the direct NZ career scope.','shortage_note','Hotel or Motel Manager is not a current Green List occupation.','visa_basis','Clear ANZSCO skill-level management occupation without targeted Green List treatment; 5/10.','salary_method','Tahatū most-common annual range NZ$58,000–$103,000; midpoint NZ$80,500, equivalent to about NZ$38.70/hour; 6/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū describes experience plus advanced hospitality certificate/diploma or tertiary study, with training around 0–2 years; 12/15.','entry_burden_basis','Manager certification can apply to licensed-alcohol duties but is not universal to all hotel managers; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
('NZ:restaurant-manager','2026-08-11',null,32.45,67500,0,0,0,0,12,4,0,5,5,26,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ANZSCO 1.3 141111 Cafe or Restaurant Manager.','shortage_note','Cafe or Restaurant Manager is not a current Green List occupation.','visa_basis','Clear ANZSCO management occupation without targeted Green List treatment; 5/10.','salary_method','Tahatū most-common annual range NZ$52,000–$83,000; midpoint NZ$67,500, about NZ$32.45/hour; 4/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū notes experience and relevant food, tourism or hospitality qualifications, with training around 0–2 years; 12/15.','entry_burden_basis','Licence Controller Qualification/Manager certificate may apply to licensed premises but is not universal; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
