('NZ:tourism-manager','2026-08-11',null,32.69,68000,0,0,0,0,10,4,0,5,5,24,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','Canonical Tourism Manager is conservatively constrained to ANZSCO 1.3 142116 Travel Agency Manager rather than the entire tourism sector.','shortage_note','No current Green List or tourism-manager-specific shortage credit is used.','visa_basis','Clear narrow ANZSCO management scope without targeted Green List treatment; 5/10.','salary_method','Tahatū Travel Agent feeder proxy most-common annual range NZ$53,000–$83,000; midpoint NZ$68,000, about NZ$32.69/hour. This is explicitly a proxy rather than an exact manager earnings series; 4/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū describes experience and relevant tourism study for travel-sector entry; manager progression requires additional responsibility, so 10/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal personal tourism-manager registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
